@title Cabinet heat: the Flow menu draws arrows, streamlines or a speed map on one m/s key
@area Heat
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The example cabinet, coarse run from the command field. The Heat strip has one Flow menu and a Strength slider (it replaces the Airflow chip); every mode shares the m/s key at the bottom left of the plate. The pictures are the evidence (drawn arrows, colour and text).
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Simulate heat of the cabinet
wait 4
key Enter
wait_s 120
expect "· it "
click_text Off
click_text Streamlines
wait 10
shot 01-streamlines
click_text Streamlines
click_text Arrows
wait 10
shot 02-arrows
click_text Arrows
click_text "Speed map"
wait 10
shot 03-speed-map
check_layout
